  "ingredients": [
    "3 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "1 lemon, quartered",
    "2 teaspoons garlic powder, divided",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper, divided",
    "2 (14.5 ounce) cans chicken broth",
    "0.25 cup fresh lemon juice",
    "1 (8 ounce) package rotelle pasta",
    "1 cup heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon grated lemon zest"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ERbykaW_uRd60_jUGYyDfHzXquM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-01-3f8f8f727cf442d69f21494a99bdd161.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken in a lightly greased baking dish. Squeeze lemon over both sides of the chicken breasts and season both sides using 1 ½ teaspoons garlic powder and ¾ teaspoon pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ws_HAb3OTb2g9lnGGGpfHfS7y6I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-02-6b045196cb8d44759199f58342aa185d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until juices run clear and chicken is no longer pink inside, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iOhCKeceQKrWWNJLSYgs__ZHJsc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-03-355ece3911514fa6a5667e264342b538.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, in a large saucepan, season the chicken broth with the remaining 1/2 teaspoon garlic powder and 1/4 teaspoon pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/acjs1Fb2srIOclVhy8ILynKjK3A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-04-1638a2f0a54b4db5bc403d0f0ffd85d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil and add lemon juice and pasta. Cook over medium heat, stirring occasionally, until all liquid is absorbed, about 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T2Q5e1VAplOWwJm6Y3O7KDyN7y4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-05-6feaaa6dee544be39a7a4b6a71e55d41.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut cooked chicken into bite-sized pieces and stir into cooked pasta, along with the cream and lemon zest. Cook, stirring, over low heat for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EjAUlZtOhbFYFFcq1ZxHpHwlI4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-26277-lemon-cream-pasta-with-chicken-VAT-step-06-1a82d6da633d4ef1852e3f100f189ccf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26277/step_06.webp"
    }
